# ==============================================================================
# NeuroLab AI - Trivy Vulnerability Suppressions Policy (.trivyignore)
# ==============================================================================
# Security Policy Requirement (Problem 37):
# Unsuppressed CRITICAL and HIGH vulnerabilities will fail the CI/CD pipeline (exit-code: 1).
#
# Process for Approved Exceptions & Expiring Suppressions:
# 1. Any exception must be formally reviewed and approved by the Security Lead.
# 2. Every entry MUST include:
#    - Valid Vulnerability ID (CVE-YYYY-XXXXX, GHSA-XXXX-XXXX-XXXX, etc.)
#    - Business/Technical justification (Reason)
#    - Compensating control description
#    - Approved-By email / identity
#    - Strict expiration date (Expiry: YYYY-MM-DD, max 90 days from granting)
#    - Native Trivy expiration comment (exp:YYYY-MM-DD)
# 3. Expired suppressions are rejected by CI and will immediately block releases.
#
# Schema Template:
# CVE-YYYY-NNNNN
# # Description: Example description
# # Reason: Upstream fix in progress; component not reachable from network
# # Compensating-Control: Strict ingress firewall and input validation
# # Approved-By: security-lead@neurolab.ai
# # Expiry: 2026-12-31
# # exp:2026-12-31
# ==============================================================================

